Package: picard
Title: Tools for Coordinating Modular R Scripts in a Data Transformation Pipeline
Version: 1.2.4
Authors@R:
    person("Mattia", "Cinelli", , "m.cinelli@umcutrecht.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a unified interface to configure, trigger, and log
    multi-step ETL pipelines (T2-T5) used for clinical data harmonisation
    and analysis within the VAC4EU network and the UMC Utrecht Digital
    Research Environment (DRE). The package supports project-specific
    transformation scripts, configuration-driven control of pipeline
    substeps, logging, auditing, plotting, and reproducibility tracking.
    It is designed to promote consistent, transparent, and reproducible
    execution of data processing pipelines.
